# Capacitor
# The native projects are generated by `npx cap add android|ios`, so they are
# not tracked: a committed copy drifts from the Capacitor version that created
# it, and every `cap add` would rewrite it. The parts that must survive - the
# branded icon, splash and notification artwork - live in native/android/res/
# and are copied over the generated project by scripts/generate-android-icons.sh
# and the Android workflow.
/android/
/ios/
ios/Pods/
ios/.xcodebuild/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

